Entitlements Not Required

Licensee is not required to obtain entitlements to the Program for the following:
  1. Network infrastructure (such as Switches, Routers, AV, FIM, Proxies, IPS,
     DLP, load balancers, firewalls)
  2. Client Devices (single user computing devices or special purpose sensors)
  3. IBM Security Guardium Aggregator Software Appliance and IBM Security Guardium
     Collector Software Appliance
